{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55722","headline":"颂 一 · 师备","name":"颂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄沙游径别，时人切须知。\n三冬阳气盛，六月降霜时。\n有语非关舌，无言切要辞（《五灯会元》卷七作「词」）。\n会我最後句，出世少人知。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}